## 📥 Installation & Setup

### 1. Clone the Repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/ecommerce-sql-analysis.git
cd ecommerce-sql-analysis
```

### 2. Choose Your Database

#### For SQLite:
```bash
# Install SQLite (if not already installed)
sudo apt-get install sqlite3  # Linux
brew install sqlite           # macOS

# Create database
sqlite3 ecommerce.db < ecommerce_analysis.sql
```

#### For MySQL:
```bash
# Login to MySQL
mysql -u your_username -p

# Create database
CREATE DATABASE ecommerce_analysis;
USE ecommerce_analysis;

# Run the SQL file
SOURCE ecommerce_analysis.sql;
```

#### For PostgreSQL:
```bash
# Create database
createdb ecommerce_analysis

# Run the SQL file
psql -d ecommerce_analysis -f ecommerce_analysis.sql
```

### 3. Verify Installation
Run a simple query to verify setup:
```sql
SELECT COUNT(*) as total_customers FROM customers;
-- Expected result: 10
```

